  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 14.0% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $3.01B (14.0% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/tradfi-and-fintech/the-amc-fight-turned-into-an-industry-argument-over-which-tokenized-stock-model-wins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The AMC Fight Turned Into An Industry Argument Over Which Tokenized Stock Model Wins</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/defi/kraken-launches-xstocks-vaults-that-borrow-against-tokenized-equities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kraken Launches xStocks Vaults That Borrow Against Tokenized Equities</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Why this investment bank expects little demand for tokenized stocks despite SEC\u2019s new trading rules</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
